type 21:19 argument 1 of 'push' expects an array or a MutableArray, found Set<int>
type 24:21 argument 1 of 'insert' expects an array or a MutableArray, found Set<int>
type 25:12 argument 1 of 'insert' expects an array or a MutableArray, found MutableSet<int>
type 26:12 argument 1 of 'insert' expects an array or a MutableArray, found MutableMap<string, int>
type 29:14 a set has no 'set' -- use add(set, item) to add an item
type 30:5 a set has no 'set' -- use add(set, item) to add an item
type 31:5 a MutableArray element is written with 'b[i] = value', not with 'set'
